    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Privacy Policy\n\nOperator: Vyacheslav Kushnir\nContact: slava13795kush@mail.ru\n\n1. File processing. All files are processed locally on your device. The app does not upload your files to any server.\n\n2. Analytics. With your consent, the app collects anonymous usage statistics (screens opened and features used) using AppMetrica and MyTracker. This data does not contain file contents or personal information. You can disable it at any time in Settings.\n\n3. Permissions. Internet access is used only for analytics and for downloading OCR language models. The advertising identifier is accessed by the analytics SDKs.\n\n4. Data retention. Statistics are stored by the analytics providers according to their policies.\n\n5. Contact. For any questions, contact the operator at the email above.</string>

